  "The value.": "",
  "Your fields and value may be plain or reactive; the builder reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. The rows are drawn again; a value changed in place is read into the tree.": "",
  "A condition or group is about to be / was added: `{ item, group, byUser, source }`; change `e.item` before it is added, or `e.cancel = true`.": "",
