  "`{ item, change: 'field' | 'operation' | 'value' | 'groupOperation', value, previousValue, byUser, source }`; change `e.value`, or `e.cancel = true`.": "",
  "Before a value editor is made: `{ field, operation, value, condition, part: 'value' | 'from' | 'to', options, editor, setValue }`. Change `e.options` (the kit editor's props), set `e.editor` to a component of your own (it calls `e.setValue`), or `e.cancel = true` for none.": ""
